OL,3,GNEWSAWatford fans state 'loss of
OL,4,Aconfidence' in ownership
OL,5,
OL,6,FWatford FC fans have published an open
OL,7,Fletter declaring their "complete loss
OL,8,Fof confidence" in the owner of the
OL,9,Ffootball club following the team's poor
OL,10,Fstart to the season.
OL,12,FThe letter, from The 1881 Movement
OL,13,Fsupporter group and signed by spokesman
OL,14,FRoy Moore, criticised decision-making
OL,15,Fand the "revolving door of managers".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
