OL,3,GNEWSAWatford fans state 'loss of
OL,4,Aconfidence' in ownership
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns about performances were echoed
OL,7,Fby Watford MP Matt Turmaine following
OL,8,Fthe team's 5-1 "thrashing" at Cardiff
OL,9,Fon Tuesday, with the club's honorary
OL,10,Flife president, Sir Elton John, also
OL,11,Fexpressing his disappointment after a
OL,12,Frecent 4-0 loss at home to Burnley.
OL,14,FThe club said it had requested a
OL,15,Fmeeting with Moore and that it "shared"
OL,16,FSir Elton's "disappointment" with
OL,17,Fresults.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
